{"seq":1,"slug":"dspy-prompt-optimization","title":"DSPy 声明式提示优化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/prompt-engineering/systems/dspy-prompt-optimization","wordCount":1003,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"dspy-声明式提示优化\">DSPy 声明式提示优化</h1><p>手工提示工程面临一个根本性矛盾：开发者花费数小时打磨提示措辞，但模型更新后这些精心设计的措辞可能突然失效。DSPy（Declarative Self-improving Python）从根本上解决了这个问题——它将提示从手工艺品转变为可自动优化的程序参数。开发者只需声明&quot;输入是什么、输出是什么、什么算好&quot;，框架自动搜索最优的提示文本、示例选择和推理策略。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-从命令式到声明式的范式转换\">核心概念：从命令式到声明式的范式转换</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[传统提示工程] --&gt; B[手写提示文本]&#10;    B --&gt; C[测试效果]&#10;    C --&gt; D{满意?}&#10;    D --&gt;|否| B&#10;    D --&gt;|是| E[部署]&#10;&#10;    F[DSPy 范式] --&gt; G[声明 Signature]&#10;    G --&gt; H[定义 Metric]&#10;    H --&gt; I[选择 Optimizer]&#10;    I --&gt; J[自动搜索最优提示]&#10;    J --&gt; K[编译为优化后的程序]&#10;    K --&gt; L[部署]\">flowchart LR\n    A[传统提示工程] --&gt; B[手写提示文本]\n    B --&gt; C[测试效果]\n    C --&gt; D{满意?}\n    D --&gt;|否| B\n    D --&gt;|是| E[部署]\n\n    F[DSPy 范式] --&gt; G[声明 Signature]\n    G --&gt; H[定义 Metric]\n    H --&gt; I[选择 Optimizer]\n    I --&gt; J[自动搜索最优提示]\n    J --&gt; K[编译为优化后的程序]\n    K --&gt; L[部署]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>传统提示工程</th>\n<th>DSPy 声明式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>提示文本</td>\n<td>人工手写，固定</td>\n<td>框架自动生成、可学习</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>示例选择</td>\n<td>凭经验挑选</td>\n<td>基于 metric 自动筛选</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>推理策略</td>\n<td>手动选 CoT/few-shot</td>\n<td>框架自动选择最优策略</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>模型更换</td>\n<td>需重新调试</td>\n<td>重新编译即可</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>质量保证</td>\n<td>人工评估</td>\n<td>metric 自动度量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可复现性</td>\n<td>依赖个人经验</td>\n<td>完全可复现的编译过程</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"dspy-2-4-核心编程模型\">DSPy 2.4+ 核心编程模型</h2><p>DSPy 的编程模型由三个核心抽象构成：</p>\n<p><strong>Signature（签名）</strong>：声明模块的输入输出契约，等价于函数类型签名。框架据此生成提示模板。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import dspy&#10;&#10;# 方式1: 简洁的字符串签名&#10;classify = dspy.Predict(&quot;document -&gt; category, confidence&quot;)&#10;&#10;# 方式2: 结构化的类签名（推荐，支持字段描述）&#10;class SentimentAnalysis(dspy.Signature):&#10;    &quot;&quot;&quot;分析客户评价的情感倾向和关键主题&quot;&quot;&quot;&#10;    review = dspy.InputField(desc=&quot;客户评价原文&quot;)&#10;    sentiment = dspy.OutputField(desc=&quot;情感: positive/negative/neutral/mixed&quot;)&#10;    themes = dspy.OutputField(desc=&quot;关键主题列表，逗号分隔&quot;)&#10;    confidence = dspy.OutputField(desc=&quot;置信度 0.0-1.0&quot;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dspy</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 方式1: 简洁的字符串签名</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">classify </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dspy.Predict(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"document -> category, confidence\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 方式2: 结构化的类签名（推荐，支持字段描述）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> SentimentAnalysis</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">dspy</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Signature</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"\"\"分析客户评价的情感倾向和关键主题\"\"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    review </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dspy.InputField(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">desc</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"客户评价原文\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    sentiment </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dspy.OutputField(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">desc</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"情感: positive/negative/neutral/mixed\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    themes </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dspy.OutputField(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">desc</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"关键主题列表，逗号分隔\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    confidence </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dspy.OutputField(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">desc</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"置信度 0.0-1.0\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>Module（模块）</strong>：封装推理策略的可组合单元。内置模块包括 <code>dspy.Predict</code>（直接预测）、<code>dspy.ChainOfThought</code>（推理链）、<code>dspy.ReAct</code>（工具交互）等。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"class CustomerInsightPipeline(dspy.Module):&#10;    def __init__(self):&#10;        super().__init__()&#10;        self.analyze = dspy.ChainOfThought(SentimentAnalysis)&#10;        self.summarize = dspy.Predict(&quot;themes, sentiment -&gt; business_insight&quot;)&#10;&#10;    def forward(self, review):&#10;        analysis = self.analyze(review=review)&#10;        insight = self.summarize(&#10;            themes=analysis.themes,&#10;            sentiment=analysis.sentiment&#10;        )&#10;        return dspy.Prediction(&#10;            sentiment=analysis.sentiment,&#10;            insight=insight.business_insight&#10;        )\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> CustomerInsightPipeline</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">dspy</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Module</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> __init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        super</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">__init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.analyze </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dspy.ChainOfThought(SentimentAnalysis)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.summarize </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dspy.Predict(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"themes, sentiment -> business_insight\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> forward</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, review):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        analysis </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.analyze(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">review</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">review)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        insight </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.summarize(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">            themes</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">analysis.themes,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">            sentiment</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">analysis.sentiment</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dspy.Prediction(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">            sentiment</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">analysis.sentiment,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">            insight</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">insight.business_insight</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        )</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>Metric（度量）</strong>：定义&quot;什么是好的输出&quot;的评判函数。DSPy 2.4+ 要求返回 0.0-1.0 的浮点数。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"def quality_metric(example, prediction, trace=None):&#10;    correct_sentiment = (prediction.sentiment == example.expected_sentiment)&#10;    has_themes = len(prediction.themes.split(&quot;,&quot;)) &gt;= 2&#10;    return float(correct_sentiment and has_themes)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> quality_metric</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(example, prediction, trace</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">None</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    correct_sentiment </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (prediction.sentiment </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> example.expected_sentiment)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    has_themes </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> len</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(prediction.themes.split(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\",\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> float</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(correct_sentiment </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">and</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> has_themes)</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"优化器-自动搜索最优提示配置\">优化器：自动搜索最优提示配置</h2><p>DSPy 的核心价值在其优化器（Optimizer）——它们自动搜索最优的提示文本、示例组合和模块配置：</p>\n<p><strong>MIPROv2（Multi-prompt Instruction Proposal Optimizer v2）</strong>：当前最强的通用优化器。工作流程：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>Bootstrap 阶段</strong>：运行未优化程序收集输入输出轨迹，用 metric 过滤高质量轨迹</li>\n<li><strong>提案生成阶段</strong>：基于程序代码、数据和轨迹，批量生成候选指令文本</li>\n<li><strong>离散搜索阶段</strong>：在训练集小批量上评估候选组合，用代理模型引导搜索方向</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"optimizer = dspy.MIPROv2(&#10;    metric=quality_metric,&#10;    num_candidates=20,       # 每个模块生成 20 条候选指令&#10;    num_threads=4,           # 并行评估&#10;    max_bootstrapped_demos=4 # 每个模块最多 4 个自动示例&#10;)&#10;&#10;optimized_pipeline = optimizer.compile(&#10;    CustomerInsightPipeline(),&#10;    trainset=train_examples,  # 最少 10 条，推荐 50+&#10;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">optimizer </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dspy.MIPROv2(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    metric</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">quality_metric,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    num_candidates</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">20</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,       </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 每个模块生成 20 条候选指令</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    num_threads</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,           </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 并行评估</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    max_bootstrapped_demos</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # 每个模块最多 4 个自动示例</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">optimized_pipeline </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> optimizer.compile(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    CustomerInsightPipeline(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    trainset</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">train_examples,  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 最少 10 条，推荐 50+</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>BootstrapFewShot</strong>：更轻量的优化器，专注于自动生成高质量的 few-shot 示例：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"optimizer = dspy.BootstrapFewShot(&#10;    metric=quality_metric,&#10;    max_bootstrapped_demos=4,&#10;    max_labeled_demos=8&#10;)&#10;compiled = optimizer.compile(pipeline, trainset=examples)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">optimizer </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dspy.BootstrapFewShot(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    metric</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">quality_metric,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    max_bootstrapped_demos</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    max_labeled_demos</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">8</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">compiled </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> optimizer.compile(pipeline, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">trainset</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">examples)</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>GEPA（最新）</strong>：2026 年新增的优化器，结合进化搜索和梯度启发式，在指令优化上超越 MIPROv2 约 5-10%。</p>\n<p><strong>优化器组合</strong>：DSPy 的独特优势是优化器可以链式组合——先用 MIPROv2 优化指令，再用 BootstrapFinetune 将优化后的提示&quot;蒸馏&quot;为模型权重更新：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"# 先优化提示&#10;prompted = dspy.MIPROv2(metric=m).compile(program, trainset=data)&#10;# 再蒸馏为微调&#10;finetuned = dspy.BootstrapFinetune(metric=m).compile(prompted, trainset=data)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 先优化提示</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">prompted </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dspy.MIPROv2(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">metric</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">m).compile(program, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">trainset</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">data)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 再蒸馏为微调</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">finetuned </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dspy.BootstrapFinetune(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">metric</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">m).compile(prompted, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">trainset</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">data)</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"生产部署模式\">生产部署模式</h2><p><strong>编译结果的持久化</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"# 保存优化后的程序&#10;optimized_pipeline.save(&quot;artifacts/pipeline_v2.json&quot;)&#10;&#10;# 加载并使用&#10;loaded = CustomerInsightPipeline()&#10;loaded.load(&quot;artifacts/pipeline_v2.json&quot;)&#10;result = loaded(review=&quot;产品质量不错但发货太慢&quot;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 保存优化后的程序</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">optimized_pipeline.save(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"artifacts/pipeline_v2.json\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 加载并使用</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">loaded </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> CustomerInsightPipeline()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">loaded.load(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"artifacts/pipeline_v2.json\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">result </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> loaded(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">review</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"产品质量不错但发货太慢\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>版本管理与监控</strong>：将编译产物纳入 Git 版本控制，配合 metric 监控持续验证线上效果。当 metric 下降超过阈值时触发重新编译。</p>\n<p><strong>多模型适配</strong>：同一个 DSPy 程序可以编译到不同的底层模型——切换模型只需重新 <code>compile()</code>，无需重写提示：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"dspy.configure(lm=dspy.LM(&quot;openai/gpt-5.4&quot;))&#10;gpt_version = optimizer.compile(pipeline, trainset=data)&#10;&#10;dspy.configure(lm=dspy.LM(&quot;anthropic/claude-opus-4-8&quot;))&#10;claude_version = optimizer.compile(pipeline, trainset=data)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">dspy.configure(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">lm</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">dspy.LM(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"openai/gpt-5.4\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">gpt_version </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> optimizer.compile(pipeline, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">trainset</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">data)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">dspy.configure(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">lm</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">dspy.LM(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"anthropic/claude-opus-4-8\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">claude_version </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> optimizer.compile(pipeline, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">trainset</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">data)</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"dspy-的适用边界\">DSPy 的适用边界</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>适合使用 DSPy</th>\n<th>不适合使用 DSPy</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>可度量的任务（有明确 metric）</td>\n<td>纯创意生成（无客观评判标准）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>需要跨模型迁移的管道</td>\n<td>一次性的简单查询</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多模块组合的复杂流程</td>\n<td>单步直接问答</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>需要持续优化的生产系统</td>\n<td>探索性研究和原型</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>有 10+ 标注样本可用</td>\n<td>零数据冷启动场景</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>DSPy 将提示从手工文本转为可编译的声明式程序</li>\n<li>三大核心抽象：Signature 声明契约、Module 封装策略、Metric 定义质量</li>\n<li>MIPROv2 是 2026 年最强通用优化器，通过 bootstrap→提案→搜索 三阶段工作</li>\n<li>优化器可链式组合，从提示优化一路到微调蒸馏</li>\n<li>生产部署通过持久化编译产物、版本管理和 metric 监控实现</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"prompt-evaluation-and-testing\">提示评估与测试</a>——DSPy metric 设计与更广义的提示评估体系</li>\n<li><a href=\"../../llm-fine-tuning/methods/lora-qlora\">LoRA 与 QLoRA</a>——当 DSPy 提示优化达到瓶颈时，参数高效微调是下一步</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"DSPy 声明式提示优化","id":"dspy-声明式提示优化"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：从命令式到声明式的范式转换","id":"核心概念-从命令式到声明式的范式转换"},{"level":2,"text":"DSPy 2.4+ 核心编程模型","id":"dspy-2-4-核心编程模型"},{"level":2,"text":"优化器：自动搜索最优提示配置","id":"优化器-自动搜索最优提示配置"},{"level":2,"text":"生产部署模式","id":"生产部署模式"},{"level":2,"text":"DSPy 的适用边界","id":"dspy-的适用边界"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"结构化输出约束","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/prompt-engineering/techniques/structured-outputs"},"next":{"title":"多模态提示设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/prompt-engineering/systems/multimodal-prompts"}}